   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
   "body_html": "It is not safe. Possible duplicate of <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/q/2425728/608639\">delete vs delete&#91;&#93; operators in C++</a>, <a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/q/4670782/608639\">The difference between delete and delete&#91;&#93; in C++</a>, etc. For a concrete example of the problem, see Raymond Chen&#39;s <a href=\"https://devblogs.microsoft.com/oldnewthing/?p=40763\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">Mismatching scalar and vector new and delete</a>."
